[2026-08-25T13:53:10.110Z]   a requirement dependency on it.
[2026-08-25T13:53:10.110Z] • A unit may be started when needed via activation (socket, path, timer,
[2026-08-25T13:53:10.110Z]   D-Bus, udev, scripted systemctl call, ...).
[2026-08-25T13:53:10.110Z] • In case of template units, the unit is meant to be enabled with some
[2026-08-25T13:53:10.110Z]   instance name specified.
